--- TEST 1: c3 (=alpha_1) IS an exact Hopfield/Ising quadratic energy ---
H1: c3(bits) = const + lin.b + b^T Quad b, built EXACTLY from THM-554
    (score s_v affine in tile bits; c3 = C(n,3) - sum_v C(s_v,2)).
  n=3: F=1 bits, 2 tilings, quadratic-vs-brute mismatches=0  [EXACT MATCH]  max c3=1
        c3-maximizer score multiset(s) (sorted out-deg): [[1, 1, 1]]
  n=4: F=3 bits, 8 tilings, quadratic-vs-brute mismatches=0  [EXACT MATCH]  max c3=2
        c3-maximizer score multiset(s) (sorted out-deg): [[1, 1, 2, 2]]
  n=5: F=6 bits, 64 tilings, quadratic-vs-brute mismatches=0  [EXACT MATCH]  max c3=5
        c3-maximizer score multiset(s) (sorted out-deg): [[2, 2, 2, 2, 2]]
  n=6: F=10 bits, 1024 tilings, quadratic-vs-brute mismatches=0  [EXACT MATCH]  max c3=8
